## Axiom iOS Tools

### Quick Commands

| Action | Command |
|--------|---------|
| **Screenshot** | Skill: `/axiom:screenshot` (preferred) or `axe screenshot --udid ...` |
| **Visual Test** | Skill: `/axiom:test-simulator` (complete scenarios with verification) |
| **Describe UI** | `axe describe-ui --udid <SIMULATOR_UDID>` |
| **Tap element** | `axe tap --label "text" --udid <SIMULATOR_UDID>` |
| **Swipe** | `axe swipe --start-x 200 --start-y 600 --end-x 200 --end-y 200 --udid <SIMULATOR_UDID>` |

### Axiom Skills for Visual Testing

> **Use Axiom skills first** for visual testing. They are smarter than raw commands.

| Situation | Skill/Agent |
|-----------|-------------|
| Quick screenshot | `/axiom:screenshot` |
| Full visual test (scenarios, verification) | `/axiom:test-simulator` |
| Iterative debugging with screenshots | `axiom:simulator-tester` agent |

### Axiom Agents (Complex problems only)

| Situation | Agent |
|-----------|-------|
| Build fails repeatedly | `axiom:build-fixer` |
| Tests fail without clear reason | `axiom:test-debugger` |
| Flaky tests in CI | `axiom:test-failure-analyzer` |

### Axiom Skills Reference

> Consult the detailed documentation in `.claude/docs/` for each area.

#### Pre-commit Audits (Run before PR)

| Situation | Skill | Doc |
|-----------|-------|-----|
| New SwiftUI code | `/axiom:audit swiftui-architecture` | `swiftui-code-style.md` |
| New async/await code | `/axiom:audit concurrency` | `swift-concurrency.md` |
| Persistence changes | `/axiom:audit core-data` | `swiftdata.md` |
| New networking | `/axiom:audit networking` | `networking.md` |
| New UI | `/axiom:audit accessibility` | `design-system.md` |
| Codable/JSON code | `/axiom:audit codable` | `new-feature.md` |
| Before release | `/axiom:audit security` | `security-privacy.md` |

